  "author": "David Marthy <marthy.david@gmail.com>",
  "date": "2026-11-12T16:55:33Z",
  "subject": "Revert qbittorrent v5 bump: the v5 image needs a different layout (#2013)",
  "body": "The v5 image runs as nobody, uses /config/qBittorrent (XDG layout, no\nQBITTORRENT__USE_PROFILE) and its entrypoint writes there, so the pod crash-loops\nwith permission denied. Needs a values/volume migration, not just a tag bump.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n"
}
